  "question": {
    "text": "The plot that depicts the behavior of the mean free time <math><mi>&#964;</mi></math> (time between two successive collisions) for the molecules of an ideal gas, as a function of temperature <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> qualitatively, is: (Graphs are schematic and not drawn to scale)",
